<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίφᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>becoming visible,</i>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				27
			</span></i> codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμφασις</span> Schneider)
			; <i>outward appearance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βασιλική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.77.3
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν ἐ.
			καταπλαγῆναι</span> by his <i>outward appearance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.27.8
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀλήθειαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				14.2.9
			</span></i> ; but distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν
				ἐπιφάνειαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				25.3.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>indication, display,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτοιμότητος, ἀκριβείας, εὐδαιμονίας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.11.4
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12.10.4
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				31.25.7
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠθῶν</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.64K.
			</span></i>(pl.).</div>
